  object_identity
    zero patch  -> receiver value :  40/40   (metric fires when nothing is changed)
    donor patch -> receiver value :   0/40   (selectivity: survives the intervention)
    donor patch -> donor value    :  26/40   (leakage: answers the donor's question instead)

