  metric fires under zero patch : 80/80
  metric fires under real patch : 0/80
==================================================================

  VALID: the counter demonstrably fires (80/80 with no
  intervention) and is driven to zero by the intervention alone.
  The 0/240 result measures the intervention, not a broken metric.
